ttle shout  out to his superhero character to drive  his point home saying Aquaman's trying  to do the best he can for my kids for  your kids for the world clean up the  oceans clean up the land and now  apparently so is Momoa a video was  momentous as Momoa buzzing off the beard  is had for the better part of a decade  was bound to garner a ton of attention  and they got people talking fans quickly  flocked to the comment section of the  video and to Twitter to react to be  Atlas Momoa many like Twitter user at  miss Donna Cook pointed out the  unfortunate truth that not only do we  live in a world where most people don't  recycle  but we now also live in a world where  Jason Momoa no longer has a beard she  wrote in a post well done guys first you  destroyed the planet and they destroyed  Jason Momoa was beard I don't know which  is worse  shame on you all she also appended the  hashtag bring back the beard judging by  the reactions to the YouTube video which  has drawn over 4 million views after  only a couple of days people think Momoa  still looks great with or without the  beard many were more blown away by the  actors activism than by his new look as  one fan wrote on Twitter with and  without beard he's still attractive  Jason Momoa shaving his beard for a good  cause spreading awareness and the  solution at the end of the day hair  grows back in a way it's just as  infinitely recyclable a resource as  aluminum so Momoa might again sport the  lush cold Rogo beard his fans clearly  love one day whether or not that happens  though one thing's for certain Momoa  will continue trying to save the planet  and that's arguably more badass than  anything Drogo did on Game of Thrones  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite actors are coming soon  subscribe to our YouTube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]
 

